1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,407
An inspection in the spring brought outside pressure of a very specific kind.

2
00:00:04,407 --> 00:00:11,955
A classified report on the language programme in the tower called the map's claims “a decorative curtain”.

3
00:00:11,955 --> 00:00:18,248
“It is not false,” the inspector said, “but it is not success either.

4
00:00:18,248 --> 00:00:25,601
Unless you can show a real increase in comprehension, the funding goes elsewhere.”

5
00:00:25,601 --> 00:00:32,350
The students had begun to complain, and the complaint was realistic; it stung.

6
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:42,502
A movie about a miracle teacher had made the public expect miracles, and the group had to explain that a quiet change is not a disappearance.

7
00:00:42,502 --> 00:00:47,395
“We cannot motivate a funder with beauty,” Maya said.

8
00:00:47,395 --> 00:00:55,998
“We have to classify what we actually do.” The silence in the room was the loudest thing in it.

9
00:00:55,998 --> 00:01:00,542
The damage was done to their timeline rather than to their data.

10
00:01:00,542 --> 00:01:10,699
A report had to be written in prose, with no room for a lame excuse; every verb, adverb, and preposition would be examined.

11
00:01:10,699 --> 00:01:16,517
“Do not elevate the language above the evidence,” Professor Zhao said.

12
00:01:16,517 --> 00:01:21,791
“Converse with the reader, do not narrate at them.”

13
00:01:21,791 --> 00:01:31,373
The inspector was intelligent, and her intelligence was not the problem; the problem was the imaginary reader she represented.

14
00:01:31,373 --> 00:01:39,006
A vacant office, a mix of old and new rules, and a devil of a deadline made the work harder.

15
00:01:39,006 --> 00:01:44,869
The disappointment was real, and the ruin of the old plan was complete.

16
00:01:44,869 --> 00:01:49,063
“I would rather be honest than wide,” Lin wrote.

17
00:01:49,063 --> 00:01:53,612
“There is a reason we keep the ugly numbers.”

18
00:01:53,612 --> 00:01:58,256
Awareness grew slowly, and so did the paperwork.

19
00:01:58,256 --> 00:02:25,143
The coordinator overheard two students in the corridor and put their sentence at the top of the report: “It is not easy, but it is really ours.” That line did more than the thousand figures; six weeks later, twenty pages of additional material were requested, and the coordinate of their next move was actually simple: publish everything, including the failure.

20
00:02:25,143 --> 00:02:29,291
“The hindrance was never the method,” she said.

21
00:02:29,291 --> 00:02:43,368
“It was the deceptive quiet of the middle class of donors.” A regretful paragraph replaced it, and the group united behind one sentence: a small true thing, repeated.

22
00:02:43,368 --> 00:02:51,280
However, much of the paper was already written, and sometimes a single sheet could carry a speech.

23
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:56,371
They could mean it, which was not nothing.
